      "title": "Anthropic Frontier Red Team and Theorem use Claude to machine-check no-crash proofs for 239 OSS-Fuzz entry points across 123 open-source libraries at the RISC-V binary level",
      "type": "technology_news",
      "sources": [
        {
          "platform": "official",
          "url": "https://www.anthropic.com/research/formal-verification",
